WEBVTT

00:07:57.480 --> 00:08:00.496
And I could not understand --

00:08:00.520 --> 00:08:03.376
could hardly breathe

00:08:03.400 --> 00:08:06.160
or think, or say a word.

00:08:07.400 --> 00:08:09.976
But to be clear:
the boy that I was at that time

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:12.616
would have leapt
at the chance to be harmed,

00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:15.560
to sacrifice everything,
even life, for a cause.

00:08:16.840 --> 00:08:19.536
There was something shocking, though --

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:22.296
not that there should have been,
but there was --

00:08:22.320 --> 00:08:27.256
in the notion that he might be harmed
for nothing more than being himself,

00:08:27.280 --> 00:08:29.760
which he had not even tried
to do in the first place.